    "question": {
      "text": "With $x_0=0.5$ as the initial approximation, the value of the root of $f(x)=x+\\sin x-1=0$, after first iteration by Newton Raphson method is _______.",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "0.7456"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "0.5110"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "0.4998"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "0.2644"
        }
      ],
      "marks": null,
      "negativeMarks": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    "answer": {
      "correctOption": "B",
      "correctText": "0.5110",
      "explanation": "Given, $f(x)=x+\\sin x-1=0$, so $f'(x)=1+\\cos x$ and $x_0=0.5$.\nBy Newton Raphson’s method,\n$$x_1=x_0-\\frac{f(x_0)}{f'(x_0)}\n=0.5-\\frac{0.5+\\sin(0.5)-1}{1+\\cos(0.5)}\n=0.5110.$$\nChoice (B)",
      "status": "confirmed"
    },
    "classification": {
      "subject": "Engineering Mathematics",
