    "question": {
      "text": "The following table gives the velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$.\n\nThe distance moved by the particle in 12 seconds, when calculated by the Trapeziodal rule with $h=2$ is ________.",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "options": [
