    "question": {
      "text": "The central difference operator $\\delta$ is defined as $y_{r}-y_{r-1}=\\delta y_{r-\\frac12}$. Then which of the following is an identity? (Note that $\\Delta$ and $\\nabla$ denote the forward and the backward difference operators respectively)",
