    },
    "answer": {
      "correctOption": "B",
      "correctText": "24",
      "explanation": "Given pairs of values:\n$$\\begin{array}{c|ccc}\nx&0&3&4\\\\\nf(x)&-12&6&12\n\\end{array}$$\nBy Lagrange’s interpolation formula,\n$$f(x)=\\frac{(x-3)(x-4)}{(0-3)(0-4)}(-12)\n+\\frac{(x-0)(x-4)}{(3-0)(3-4)}(6)\n+\\frac{(x-0)(x-3)}{(4-0)(4-3)}(12).$$\nTaking $x=6$,\n$$f(6)=\\frac{(6-3)(6-4)}{3\\times4}(-12)\n+\\frac{(6-0)(6-4)}{3\\times(-1)}(6)\n+\\frac{(6-0)(6-3)}{4\\times1}(12)\n=24.$$\nChoice (B)",
      "status": "confirmed"
    },
